          "en": "and I'll add this method to my shopping added component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 38.46,
          "en": "While in on delete, what do we need to do here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "We need to inform the service that it should remove",
