          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "but I think that's okay like this, too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 94.14,
          "en": "So here I will slice or simply pass a copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.14,
          "end": 95.67,
          "en": "of my ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 100.05,
          "en": "And with that, the final step is before we clear everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.05,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "I will reach out to my shopping list service,",
