        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.37,
          "en": "without loading an item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.37,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "So, therefore, I will simply add NGF to the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.51,
